1
00:00:06,350 --> 00:00:11,830
Assalomu alaykum! Men Asadbek, 54-maktabning 8-E sinfida oʻqiyman.

2
00:00:11,830 --> 00:00:15,963
Bugun — 18-noyabr, Davlat bayrogʻimiz kuni!

3
00:00:16,250 --> 00:00:21,300
1991-yil 18-noyabrda Davlat bayrogʻi qonuni qabul qilingan.

4
00:00:21,300 --> 00:00:25,000
Moviy — mangu osmon va obihayot ramzi.

5
00:00:25,000 --> 00:00:28,250
Oq — tinchlik va poklik ramzi.

6
00:00:28,250 --> 00:00:32,100
Yashil — yangilanayotgan tabiat ramzi.

7
00:00:32,100 --> 00:00:35,400
Qizil chiziqlar — hayotiy kuch.

8
00:00:35,400 --> 00:00:38,650
Yarim oy — mustaqillik ramzi.

9
00:00:38,650 --> 00:00:42,383
12 yulduz — qadimiy quyosh yil hisobi.

10
00:00:52,950 --> 00:00:56,083
Bayrogʻimiz — gʻururimiz!

11
00:00:56,100 --> 00:00:58,967
Bayramingiz muborak!
